@url=http://localhost:3000/api

### Login correcto
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "nuevo@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### Token 
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}} 

### Obtener categorias
GET {{url}}/categorias 

### Crear categoria
POST {{url}}/categorias
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nombre": "Categoria de prueba"
}

### Obtener categoria por id
GET {{url}}/categorias/8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Actualizar categoria
PUT {{url}}/categorias/8
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "nombre": "Categoria de prueba actualizada"
}

### Eliminar categoria
DELETE {{url}}/categorias/8
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}